# ============================================================
# GATE COMPASS — Environment Variables
# ============================================================

# Turso Persistent Database (Required for Vercel / Production deployment)
# Create a free database at https://turso.tech or via the Turso CLI:
# 1. turso db create gate-compass
# 2. turso db show gate-compass (copy URL)
# 3. turso db tokens create gate-compass (copy token)
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=libsql://gate-compass-username.turso.io
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=your_turso_jwt_auth_token_here

# Local Development Note:
# If TURSO_DATABASE_URL is left empty, the application automatically
# falls back to a persistent local SQLite database file: 'file:gate_compass.db'
